 24px; font-size: 16px;"&gt;总体而言，2026 年对于全球种植者来说是&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/y-AmK6_GCuEiB6W2HcRZ_O94huFQ_jHWgF9ZSa6GTrKTvOSLgrK72DXC0eOhwj23Td1VwjCAPEweCPM8x89QwK8_ggbv2vGkXEUZd64xh0SSQIk4yCXJ4oumP4DtBwxGIbVhOgGX_2IRr_QbCVfFNp1UU0LxkKSBihpDPM9sXOrSEGsfiyixYb9-6jZpOsLIDGduV0ykiiJ93AiTkvG52dVGcFpyrrd_1a9WaMzPzglyGkWElBs3TPWKMgCIyGWYwK52ZR5sp53qsXEc5H1TLRJfHrFP96aix6wPw8mKzBfHgli2xQp53nPrgxCa3MNLCXllC55Z5uwW_945qv4U5f1enushAk2nmXAhI8uW0ITeN4kB26O1fViE0idulG3LnViPiU_4FqKnU16aI2ctQAMlDugyvxnrT1ekO1ASWb6DdEGrzHLtAJvOIGph_tztvpSgoVF0mtf-uO7Itbu39hleibEZpkRFbsiuyPeeFUBgE_XPkoP-qkxMaW0hEBvAyNAL5HDEDds0EkV26WeKxZ0aJdG2RTZFCO3ms4o-wKgqAYv2terk8J53/7_W7C6hvF864iF8akYbUUkFKGcmBR44n/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="战争和天气推动农作物价格创 2012 年以来最大月度涨幅"&gt;艰难的一年&lt;/a&gt;。除了地缘政治紧张局势颠覆了中东和黑海的重要贸易走廊、导致投入成本飙升之外，极端天气还破坏了收成，并已经开始威胁明年作物的&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/PstcdFyen5B2uXirDQDpkCO1Dr7qB787K0OYXhZ7qCZoreXAecnOYy8E7rPApqYiTHahxVmh87yFRpwHbpb5MfkvY-XyJyYNuCZzh0J8GjjGPkHUPREcVKxLXSCOka0s07RL325VYxsFjFglYPD64V-u6p4mNnVd_AZX9iDv2mmBCZOgFn0BOlpJHXiV4R3PT35vDbx6XGzt6ocVm9Qj1RPZzb4zrJbzxfXXiP4oUx4XXsuxDGtReNCDlP0ynMUXwip7Xppuv-FReVXcHy9_we7f_7w71eUpgPSNAXJqdbqetQgYIeciiAp35AH1wGFx3oiHxvvzKa1gSQRUnWSwDizb668vpU1cET5YrnisMQGr6dSblASnr-JPBckUJ33U7pcIrjU0wV_unpdQ7PhASxgmeN58ovX-Pp_h8fHcUk4bR4_MPhrIgaLdecVNGDaAK6BU6CGSImAeX0mTAYJztb1WkfWqkEnViw6BL_m84RcydHCbN0vY-I76savye1btCzIhZEEtPFp4b9BNkBllX3h5YoXEUuZ8bmLte2PimPr7-cZEpMkx/HijIlwXVlboG2YaSWfWL5HcfVU7uVpx7/25" rel="noopener noreferrer" style="font-size: inherit; color: #00e;" target="_blank" title="欧洲炎热干旱的土地给明年的农作物带来风险"&gt;播种期&lt;/a&gt;。历史上严重的“超级”厄尔尼诺现象将成为 2027 年全球粮食供应&lt;a href="https://links.message.bloomberg.com/a/sc/tAlq3QD0NaUijj5isIKDxGcrfCm65pFOfRV-aiPSofi14CHdTt2K4lqkNPov2unjpcaYACPgLYJok1e92iXXJiyUq1Ndhg0Dh0GBXLjmyX7Da0ZD3OVbf5fSEd5Ft2KI2NJ1OvMuAOUeI1UBizbjvPhfKisYi2TZm90uz4hdH90QMWgNKtsukvAWeuFCUmgLg4chtjGIPBBNnifYNHeBijyv7PcrWG7G